OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1786637920
OL,3,CSouthampton base closure 'will not
OL,4,Cimpact Channel Island flights'
OL,6,FLoganair's decision to close its base
OL,7,Fat Southampton Airport will not affect
OL,8,FChannel Island services, ITV News
OL,9,Funderstands.
OL,11,FThe airline took over the lifeline
OL,12,Froute between Jersey and Southampton
OL,13,Flast November following the collapse
OL,14,Fof Blue Islands.
OL,16,FIt is a key connection to the UK for
OL,17,Fmedical appointments and ITV News
OL,18,Funderstands that all scheduled Channel
OL,19,FIsland flights will continue as normal.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/3
