OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1786637920
OL,3,CSouthampton base closure 'will not
OL,4,Cimpact Channel Island flights'
OL,6,FThe company also applied for a licence
OL,7,Fto operate the Southampton-Guernsey
OL,8,Froute but this offer was refused by
OL,9,Fthe States of Guernsey in January.
OL,11,FThe Scottish operator only opened its
OL,12,FSouthampton base in January but is now
OL,13,Fplanning to reduce some UK services
OL,14,Ffollowing what it calls "a review of
OL,15,Fwider network and operational setup".
OL,17,FThe closure at the end of October is
OL,18,Fexpected to affect flights between
OL,19,FSouthampton, Manchester and Exeter.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/3
