OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F356A1786637920
OL,3,CSouthampton base closure 'will not
OL,4,Cimpact Channel Island flights'
OL,6,FA Southampton Airport spokesperson
OL,7,Fsaid they are "disappointed by
OL,8,FLoganair's decision" but that they
OL,9,F"remain an important airline partner".
